---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Watchlist | Mohammad Yahia" description="Recommended reading and watchlist: past, ongoing, and next technical deep dives">
  <section class="watchlist-shell">
    <header class="watchlist-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">Recommended Reading & Watchlist</span>
      <h1>Technical Deep-Dive Dashboard</h1>
      <p class="lead">A curated track of past and ongoing learning across distributed systems, identity security, and architecture strategy.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="watchlist-grid">
      <div class="watchlist-column">
        <h2>Currently Analyzing</h2>

        <article class="watch-card">
          <div class="watch-card-top">
            <span class="watch-type">Book</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Designing Data-Intensive Applications: The Big Ideas Behind Reliable, Scalable, and Maintainable Systems</h3>
          <p class="meta">Book by Martin Kleppmann</p>
          <p>Deep-diving into database engine internals, partitioning mechanics, distributed replication, and stream processing primitives.</p>
          <div class="watch-badges">
            <span class="watch-badge">Distributed Systems</span>
            <span class="watch-badge">Data Engines</span>
            <span class="watch-badge">Storage Core</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="watch-card">
          <div class="watch-card-top">
            <span class="watch-type">Course</span>
          </div>
          <h3>The Nuts and Bolts of OAuth 2.0</h3>
          <p class="meta">Udemy Course by Aaron Parecki</p>
          <p>Mastering secure enterprise authorization loops, tokens, scopes, security architecture validation, and zero-trust API protection.</p>
          <p class="watch-link-row">
            <a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/oauth-2-simplified/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Course: https://www.udemy.com/course/oauth-2-simplified/</a>
          </p>
          <div class="watch-badges">
            <span class="watch-badge">Identity Security</span>
            <span class="watch-badge">OAuth 2.0 / OIDC</span>
            <span class="watch-badge">API Security</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="watchlist-column">
        <h2>Up Next in the Queue</h2>

        <article class="watch-card">
          <div class="watch-card-top">
            <span class="watch-type">Course</span>
          </div>
          <h3>Software Architecture Essentials: Masterclass</h3>
          <p class="meta">Udemy Course</p>
          <p>Analyzing architectural patterns, component isolation strategies, enterprise system patterns, and systemic scalability trade-offs.</p>
          <p class="watch-link-row">
            <a href="https://www.udemy.com/course/software-architecture-essentials/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Course: https://www.udemy.com/course/software-architecture-essentials/</a>
          </p>
          <div class="watch-badges">
            <span class="watch-badge">System Design</span>
            <span class="watch-badge">Enterprise Architecture</span>
            <span class="watch-badge">Scalability</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .watchlist-shell {
    max-width: 72rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }

  .watchlist-header {
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }

  .watchlist-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  }

  .watchlist-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .watchlist-column {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-content: start;
  }

  .watchlist-column h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .watch-card {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 65%, #0f172a 35%);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 75%, #334155 25%);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 1.2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }

  .watch-card-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .watch-type {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.22rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 28%, transparent);
  }

  .watch-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.45rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .watch-card p {
    margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
  }

  .watch-link-row a {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    word-break: break-word;
  }

  .watch-badges {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .watch-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--border) 80%, #334155 20%);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-strong) 72%, #0f172a 28%);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .watchlist-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>

